WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:36.950 --> 01:40.990
Long time no see, Human World.

01:41.720 --> 01:45.490
Tonight, I have a concert.

01:46.860 --> 01:49.460
Which outfit's the sexiest,

01:50.660 --> 01:51.750
my babies?

01:52.700 --> 01:55.000
It doesn't make a bit of difference.

01:55.000 --> 01:56.130
That's awfully cold.

01:57.370 --> 02:01.910
Um, I think it's best
not to be too flashy.

02:01.910 --> 02:06.270
Vanilla, you don't really
understand my character, do you?

02:06.750 --> 02:09.350
Vanilla-chama's sense is impeccable!

02:10.380 --> 02:12.780
Then do like me: stripes,
stripes, and more stripes!

02:12.780 --> 02:14.110
Aren't they distinctive?

02:14.110 --> 02:16.110
I'll have to pass on that.

02:16.110 --> 02:17.960
*ribbit*

02:22.460 --> 02:23.990
Why are you dressed like this?

02:24.800 --> 02:28.620
Normal fashion critics don't
just appear out of nowhere.

02:30.120 --> 02:32.400
Pardon the intrusion.

02:32.400 --> 02:37.910
I tried his house first, but came here
after finding no one at home.

02:37.910 --> 02:39.040
Ah, okay.

02:39.040 --> 02:43.250
Captain Glacier, why'd you come
here from the Magical World?

02:43.250 --> 02:48.890
Queen Candy ordered me to investigate
the Ogres in the Human World.

02:49.720 --> 02:50.860
The Ogres...

02:51.360 --> 02:52.890
You have to come with me too.

02:52.890 --> 02:55.960
Well, I'd love to do that, but...

02:56.860 --> 02:57.630
But what?

02:58.100 --> 03:01.390
Do you plan to go around
the Human World dressed like that?

03:01.670 --> 03:02.870
It stands out too much.

03:03.400 --> 03:04.910
Then what should I wear?

03:10.410 --> 03:12.110
Wow! So handsome!

03:12.110 --> 03:13.680
It really suits you!

03:17.350 --> 03:19.550
Now you look like my manager.

03:19.550 --> 03:22.150
M-me, your manager!?

03:23.220 --> 03:26.160
And now, off to the stage.

03:28.460 --> 03:31.920
The Black Heart and the Ogres' Trap.

03:34.530 --> 03:37.460
He's sooo dreamy!
Robin...

03:39.640 --> 03:42.410
Tonight we meet again, my babies!

03:44.710 --> 03:46.070
Yeah!

03:52.650 --> 03:54.920
Extase Tentaition!

03:55.650 --> 03:58.620
Your hearts... come to me.

04:03.830 --> 04:06.130
He's just as carefree as ever.

04:06.130 --> 04:09.570
But out of all the magical beings who've
ever come to the Human World,

04:09.570 --> 04:12.700
Robin's picked up the most hearts, right?

04:12.700 --> 04:15.770
He's always known
the tools of his trade.

04:18.710 --> 04:23.570
Tonight, an old friend of mine has come
to support me at this concert.

04:23.570 --> 04:24.650
Yeah!

04:25.820 --> 04:27.290
COME ON...

04:27.290 --> 04:28.490
Glacier.

04:33.790 --> 04:35.250
Glacier, a few words?

04:40.630 --> 04:42.170
Don't mess with me!

04:47.340 --> 04:49.240
Why did so many hearts come out?

04:49.770 --> 04:51.040
Pick them up.

04:52.110 --> 04:53.740
This is for the Magical World's sake.

05:09.560 --> 05:11.330
Captain Glacier is marvelous!

05:12.860 --> 05:14.700
Even Robin pales in comparison!

05:15.330 --> 05:19.250
I only came to the Human World
to investigate the Ogres.

05:19.250 --> 05:22.740
But getting this many hearts
can't be a bad thing, right?

05:22.740 --> 05:24.710
That's not the issue.

05:24.710 --> 05:28.250
Captain Glacier, maybe you could
become a star like Robin!

05:29.180 --> 05:30.580
I refuse!

05:33.990 --> 05:35.090
We're here.

05:36.150 --> 05:38.190
You're staying at my house, right?

05:41.660 --> 05:43.630
So long! Good night!

05:43.630 --> 05:45.130
Thanks for the ride!

05:46.800 --> 05:47.450
Huh?

05:47.830 --> 05:49.530
Captain Glacier's here?

05:49.530 --> 05:51.670
That guy is strict.

05:52.340 --> 05:58.180
I wonder what motivated Queen Candy and
the Council to investigate the Ogres.

06:00.250 --> 06:03.510
Queen Candy's opposed to fighting, but...

06:04.050 --> 06:07.720
what if Pierre and the Ogres attack us?

06:11.320 --> 06:13.520
Would we be forced to fight?

06:15.690 --> 06:16.810
Sorry,

06:17.230 --> 06:19.560
I've only got one bed at this house.

06:20.200 --> 06:24.000
But tomorrow, I'll definitely
get more hearts than you.

06:24.000 --> 06:26.700
I didn't come to the Human
World to take hearts!!

06:28.610 --> 06:30.770
I want to finish up my mission
and head home.

06:42.650 --> 06:43.820
Oh boy.

06:45.090 --> 06:46.260
Is this...

06:46.730 --> 06:48.990
where the Ogre Prince is?

06:48.990 --> 06:50.860
Robin! Captain Glacier!

06:53.600 --> 06:55.500
Hi, my babies!

06:57.870 --> 07:00.540
Looks like another flood of hearts...

07:00.540 --> 07:02.110
He's the one who stands out.

07:03.010 --> 07:05.150
I'm not doing this on purpose!

07:06.520 --> 07:07.470
Houx! Saule!

07:09.550 --> 07:11.220
G-good morning!

07:11.220 --> 07:14.620
Are you two here as the Queen
Candidates' Knights?

07:15.750 --> 07:16.450
Yes.

07:16.960 --> 07:18.220
Be alert.

07:18.220 --> 07:19.460
W-we will!

07:20.090 --> 07:21.390
Cho-co-lat~

07:21.390 --> 07:22.660
Who is that?

07:22.660 --> 07:24.130
Robin's friend.

07:25.830 --> 07:27.830
We go waaay back.

07:27.830 --> 07:31.200
Robin's cool,
but his friend is even cooler!

07:36.410 --> 07:37.710
Pierre.

07:38.640 --> 07:39.940
He finally appears.

07:55.490 --> 07:56.690
Your hair...

07:57.700 --> 07:58.760
feels so springy.

08:01.470 --> 08:02.630
Do the peek-a-boo glasses!

08:03.740 --> 08:04.230
Look!

08:13.950 --> 08:16.180
Good for you, Chocolat...

08:16.550 --> 08:18.550
Pierre-sama sure cares a lot about you.

08:21.250 --> 08:22.450
Even my friends...

08:24.020 --> 08:25.560
have black hearts.

08:25.560 --> 08:26.060
Damn!

08:28.660 --> 08:30.690
He knew we couldn't
do anything to him!

08:31.230 --> 08:35.030
You'll be late to class
if you don't hurry.

08:37.940 --> 08:38.620
Yes.

08:39.070 --> 08:40.040
Okay, let's go.

08:40.040 --> 08:41.000
See you later.

08:46.480 --> 08:48.710
Good morning!

08:49.010 --> 08:50.050
Chocolat...

08:50.050 --> 08:52.720
Is it all right if we stop
by your house again?

08:54.420 --> 08:55.220
No problem!

08:56.590 --> 08:58.060
Thank goodness.

08:58.060 --> 09:00.460
Their hearts were
only black for a moment.

09:00.460 --> 09:02.930
But what would happen if Pierre...

09:02.930 --> 09:05.980
cultivated black hearts inside everyone?

09:06.830 --> 09:10.000
Would the world be filled with
jealousy and hatred?

09:11.870 --> 09:13.490
That would be awful!

09:30.090 --> 09:31.790
Isn't it over yet?!

09:32.460 --> 09:36.590
I am a star, so I'm
booked solid every day.

09:36.590 --> 09:40.100
I get it now.
I'll investigate the Ogres myself.

09:40.100 --> 09:41.300
Hold on.

09:43.540 --> 09:44.500
Okay!

09:45.060 --> 09:49.310
Let's go with this picture for the
new chocolate promo poster!

09:52.780 --> 09:53.950
Chocolat-chan?

09:53.950 --> 09:55.080
Huh?

09:55.080 --> 09:58.780
I think the less you think
about Pierre, the better.

09:59.620 --> 10:00.850
Yeah, I'll know.

10:05.290 --> 10:06.390
It's cold.

10:09.330 --> 10:10.560
It's from Pierre?

10:12.260 --> 10:13.260
What's it say?

10:13.260 --> 10:15.970
"I have something
important to talk about."

10:15.970 --> 10:20.010
"I will be waiting for you this
evening in the courtyard."

10:35.890 --> 10:39.460
Why does this picture have to
be the new chocolate poster?

10:39.460 --> 10:40.860
I don't know.

10:40.860 --> 10:43.690
More importantly, is this a trap?

10:44.360 --> 10:47.090
They're inviting
us to Pierre's mansion?

10:47.090 --> 10:49.530
Seems like they want
to have a chat with us.

10:49.530 --> 10:54.640
Perhaps this is a step toward resolving the
Ogres' and Les Royaume's differences.

11:01.710 --> 11:03.920
It's brimming with Noir energy.

11:03.920 --> 11:06.020
Pierre's mansion is right over there.

11:11.060 --> 11:13.020
Pierre wants to meet Chocolat?

11:13.020 --> 11:15.190
You're not going, right?

11:15.190 --> 11:16.390
Yeah.

11:16.390 --> 11:19.000
You decided to stay
away from Pierre, right?

11:19.000 --> 11:22.330
Yeah, plus I have to focus
on collecting hearts.

11:22.330 --> 11:23.640
Good for you.

11:23.640 --> 11:25.300
Ah, Chocolat!

11:26.940 --> 11:27.870
Who are you?

11:28.970 --> 11:30.640
I'm Pierre-sama's servant.

11:30.640 --> 11:32.040
Pierre's?

11:32.040 --> 11:35.680
I'm pleased to invite you,
Chocolat Meilleure...

11:35.680 --> 11:37.810
to a dinner with Pierre-sama.

11:43.090 --> 11:44.640
Chocolat-chan!!

11:45.560 --> 11:47.130
Let's follow Chocolat!

11:47.130 --> 11:47.790
Yeah!

11:56.400 --> 11:57.600
Is this the place?

12:00.510 --> 12:01.610
We're going in.

12:02.540 --> 12:03.210
Yeah.

12:05.940 --> 12:09.150
Hey! Where are you taking me?

12:11.680 --> 12:13.080
Welcome, Chocolat.

12:23.290 --> 12:26.630
This way, you can converse
without fearing interruptions.

12:36.910 --> 12:38.340
Black hearts...

12:51.190 --> 12:54.020
There's Noir power everywhere.

12:55.160 --> 12:57.690
Why did you bring me way up here?

12:58.360 --> 13:00.400
Didn't I say I wanted to talk?

13:00.400 --> 13:01.600
About what?

13:01.600 --> 13:04.340
Do you hate me?

13:04.340 --> 13:06.240
Huh?

13:06.240 --> 13:08.040
I do like you.

13:09.640 --> 13:13.440
You are a Queen Candidate, and the
daughter of the legendary witch Cinnamon.

13:14.550 --> 13:17.050
I had wondered about
what sort of girl you were.

13:17.050 --> 13:21.420
It turns out you're a strong girl who
carves her own path in life.

13:21.420 --> 13:25.560
That's why I think you'd be
a good partner for me.

13:26.360 --> 13:27.990
What are you talking about?

13:27.990 --> 13:29.860
Do you want to become Queen?

13:31.080 --> 13:34.130
I will help you win the Queen Selection.

13:34.770 --> 13:37.800
But afterwards, I want you
to be the Ogre Queen.

13:38.140 --> 13:39.800
The Ogre Queen?

13:48.770 --> 13:49.890
What is it?

13:49.890 --> 13:50.690
I don't know.

13:56.190 --> 13:56.550
Robin!

13:58.320 --> 14:00.590
Charrue Bris!

14:06.560 --> 14:07.530
Glacier!

14:08.530 --> 14:10.170
Grand Lumiere!

14:20.910 --> 14:23.710
Oh boy, this is gonna get ugly.

14:29.550 --> 14:32.510
I don't want to use any Ogre
power to become Queen!

14:39.330 --> 14:42.500
At this rate, Vanilla will
become the next Queen.

14:42.500 --> 14:46.640
I want to go through the tests and
become Queen fair-and-square.

14:46.640 --> 14:49.910
Besides, I'll never ever
become the Ogre Queen.

14:50.840 --> 14:51.530
Why not?

14:52.080 --> 14:54.550
I can't bear the thought of
cultivating black hearts!

14:56.570 --> 14:58.040
Good for you, Chocolat...

14:58.040 --> 15:00.170
Pierre-sama sure cares a lot about you.

15:02.490 --> 15:04.150
Wait! Chocolat!

15:07.890 --> 15:10.060
You still refuse, Chocolat?

15:13.500 --> 15:15.760
You won't make use of my power?

15:16.700 --> 15:17.570
Pierre...

15:20.710 --> 15:22.370
If I had you with me...

15:30.180 --> 15:33.280
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

15:38.320 --> 15:38.960
Wand!

15:48.360 --> 15:48.970
All right!

15:49.800 --> 15:52.440
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

16:01.210 --> 16:03.550
The Magical World
is built on the powers...

16:03.550 --> 16:06.010
of humans' love,
respect, and friendship.

16:07.120 --> 16:09.290
That means we witches
have to cultivate...

16:10.390 --> 16:11.920
the power of love!

16:15.890 --> 16:16.930
What shall we do?

16:17.530 --> 16:18.460
Let her go.

16:19.230 --> 16:20.330
Yes, sir.

16:32.210 --> 16:33.440
That's right,

16:33.440 --> 16:37.580
your teacher is
trespassing in my mansion...

16:38.280 --> 16:40.450
but he might not
live to tell about it.

16:40.450 --> 16:42.320
What do you mean?

16:42.320 --> 16:46.220
We have our own special ways
of welcoming guests.

16:51.560 --> 16:55.730
We could have cast any number
of spells to make her obey us.

16:56.930 --> 16:58.840
That would be meaningless.

16:59.800 --> 17:02.940
Unless she becomes
the Ogre Queen by her own will,

17:02.940 --> 17:05.580
she will not be able to govern
the Magical World.

17:12.050 --> 17:13.820
Grand Lumiere!

17:13.820 --> 17:15.590
Charrue Bris!

17:23.260 --> 17:25.060
Charrue Bris!

17:25.700 --> 17:27.690
Grand Lumiere!

17:32.670 --> 17:33.840
There's no end to these guys.

17:33.840 --> 17:34.910
Let's get out of here.

17:34.910 --> 17:36.200
Good idea.

17:39.310 --> 17:40.980
Grand Lumiere!

17:44.220 --> 17:45.870
Charrue Bris!

17:49.950 --> 17:51.320
It's like a maze.

17:51.320 --> 17:53.010
Which way do we go?

17:56.160 --> 17:57.730
What's this fragrance?

17:57.730 --> 17:58.900
This way.

18:00.300 --> 18:01.970
Escape through here.

18:25.260 --> 18:27.160
That fragrance...

18:27.960 --> 18:29.560
It couldn't be...

18:29.560 --> 18:31.460
Robin! Captain Glacier!

18:31.460 --> 18:32.900
Are you all right?

18:32.900 --> 18:33.830
Chocolat.

18:39.140 --> 18:40.400
What happened?

18:42.110 --> 18:45.010
I just caught a whiff of a
familiar scent back there.

18:45.010 --> 18:45.940
Yeah.

18:45.940 --> 18:47.980
So what brings you here, Chocolat?

18:48.580 --> 18:49.980
Pierre told me...

18:49.980 --> 18:52.220
that you two snuck in here.

18:52.220 --> 18:55.220
So... he did lead us into a trap.

18:55.220 --> 18:59.190
And, he asked me to become
the Ogre Queen.

18:59.890 --> 19:01.390
Become the Ogre Queen...?

19:02.830 --> 19:03.490
Yes.

19:05.360 --> 19:08.400
So that was why he
got close to Chocolat.

19:08.400 --> 19:14.270
That way, the Ogres could conquer
the Magical World without a fight.

19:15.170 --> 19:18.760
I'll never become the Ogre Queen!

19:19.640 --> 19:23.470
I'm sure Mama
wouldn't have wanted that.

19:23.850 --> 19:25.520
That's right.

19:25.520 --> 19:29.890
Well, good thing you didn't let that
man's sweet words mislead you.

19:29.890 --> 19:31.560
Nice job, baby!

19:31.820 --> 19:33.220
You'd better believe it!

19:33.220 --> 19:38.430
I came to take hearts,
not to get mine taken.

19:40.830 --> 19:42.220
I'm back!

19:42.220 --> 19:43.730
Chocolat!

19:43.730 --> 19:45.220
Thank goodness you're safe!!

19:46.170 --> 19:47.940
Sorry to worry you!

19:47.940 --> 19:49.750
Chocolat-chan...

19:49.750 --> 19:53.210
So what did Pierre
want to talk about?

19:55.880 --> 19:59.250
I'd only wind up scaring
Vanilla if I told her.

19:59.250 --> 20:00.670
Oh, nothing important!

20:00.670 --> 20:02.050
Really?

20:05.590 --> 20:08.990
Chocolat-chan is definitely
hiding something.

20:10.130 --> 20:12.520
It simply can't
be anything important.

20:12.520 --> 20:14.130
I wonder about that...

20:19.540 --> 20:21.740
I have received Robin's report.

20:23.610 --> 20:26.710
Chocolat, remember to stay strong!

20:26.710 --> 20:27.530
Okay!

20:28.880 --> 20:30.250
I have high hopes for you.

20:32.180 --> 20:34.550
Queen Candy, I will do my best!

20:38.090 --> 20:41.790
So Mama only has high hopes
for Chocolat-chan?

20:42.490 --> 20:45.060
What could those two
be talking about?

20:45.060 --> 20:48.500
Why won't they tell me too?

20:49.230 --> 20:53.770
Do they all hope that
Chocolat-chan wil be the Queen?

20:59.810 --> 21:04.150
I'll leave the Queen
Candidates up to you, Robin.

21:04.620 --> 21:06.180
I understand.

21:06.180 --> 21:08.110
So are you leaving now?

21:08.520 --> 21:09.250
Yes.

21:09.250 --> 21:10.520
I see.

21:11.120 --> 21:14.490
And just when you were about to
be a star in the Human World.

21:16.190 --> 21:18.250
Talk about standing out...

21:19.100 --> 21:21.000
What an utter disgrace.

21:23.630 --> 21:26.970
I'm never setting foot in
the Human World again!

21:30.440 --> 21:31.840
They got away?

21:31.840 --> 21:36.730
The meddlesome instructor and the
Queen's guard avoided their demise.

21:36.730 --> 21:40.220
It must've taken some incredibly strong
magic to escape the mansion.

21:43.950 --> 21:47.820
So then, our Queen
Candidate will be...

21:48.460 --> 21:49.230
I know.

21:51.160 --> 21:53.900
We will make
Vanilla Mieux the Queen.

22:03.110 --> 22:06.940
I will become the Queen of the
Magical World, fair and square.

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:46.430 --> 23:49.170
Next week, I'll be running for
Student Council President.

23:49.170 --> 23:52.990
Natsume and the others
made me do it.

23:52.990 --> 23:57.160
Alrighty then, if I win I'll whup all the strict school rules!

23:57.160 --> 23:59.700
Eh? Vanilla's running too?

23:59.700 --> 24:03.620
And now Pierre and the Members are backing her?

24:03.620 --> 24:05.650
Why oh why?

24:05.650 --> 24:07.820
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.820 --> 24:11.410
Pierre's Temptation,
the Broken Friendship.

24:11.410 --> 24:13.770
Vanilla, stay away from Pierre!
